	Keywords = {Africa South of the Sahara/epidemiology; *Bacterial Vaccines/administration \& dosage; Child; Child, Preschool; Humans; *Immunization Programs; Infant; Meningitis, Meningococcal/epidemiology/*prevention \& control; Meningococcal Vaccines; *Vaccination},
